00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.460
The Bank of Canada and Fed policy paths remain the key macro backdrop with rate-sensitive

00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:34.300
sectors repricing on each decision while Canadian Wealth Mechanics in TFSA and RRSP accounts

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:40.260
